  "_criteria": {
    "n (N02 vs N04)": "N02 𐰤 is drawn with right-angled steps (two vertical stems joined by a horizontal); N04 𐰥 is a zigzag with a diagonal middle stroke.",
    "A (A00 vs A03)": "A00 𐰀 has its top flag to the right and its bottom foot to the left (ʃ-like); A03 𐰁 is the mirror image, top flag left and foot right (Z-like). A drawing that shows only one of the two strokes still decides the shape.",
    "D (D01 vs D04)": "D01 𐰑 is a double zigzag pointing right (>>); D04 points left (<<).",
    "z (Z00 vs Z03)": "Z00 𐰔 is rectangular, stepped stems; Z03 𐰕 is two crossing curves.",
    "wK (K03 vs K06)": "K03 𐰹 is an arrow pointing up; K06 𐰸 points down."
  },
